WP Starter compatibility research and source-derived material
-----------------------------------------------------------
Behavioral contracts, WordPress salt names/character catalog and section marker
conventions are derived from WP Starter. The implementation is maintained here;
WP Starter is not a runtime or development dependency. Its pinned source
revisions and individual file references are recorded in docs/source-evidence.md
and docs/upstream-inventory.json. The upstream notice is retained for any
source-derived portions, including the salt catalog, section-edit format,
WordPress constant/type catalog and environment alias order.
resources/legacy-mu-loader.php.txt and resources/legacy-mu-loader-dev.php.txt are
the pinned upstream MU loader templates, retained only for byte-exact
recognition of generated files during migration.

Source-derived API compatibility files (verified against upstream dev revision
059bbc9198ac51dee86c5233b6b006ca4d8008a4):
- src/Process/PhpTool.php adapts src/Cli/PhpTool.php: tool interface method
  signatures, with SymPress namespace and service types.
- src/Step/NullStep.php adapts src/Step/NullStep.php: extensible no-op step
  contract and return values, using SymPress StepInterface.
- src/Step/ScriptHaltSignal.php adapts src/Step/ScriptHaltSignal.php: propagation
  and step-halting factories/accessors, with readonly promoted properties.
