Generated standalone parser payloads
-----------------------------------
The payload builder scopes the installed Symfony Dotenv parser and its Symfony
Process dependencies into an isolated namespace. It retains their original
copyright headers and distributes each component's MIT LICENSE alongside the
generated source. Composer CLI/DI/Messenger integrations are not bundled.
